WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.980
The Rose of Versailles

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.980
The Rose of Versailles

00:00:19.270 --> 00:00:24.800
<i>Long after their first encounter, two souls
had finally become one, as man and wife.</i>

00:00:25.710 --> 00:00:30.050
<i>It was an era where everything
was about to be born anew.</i>

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:34.520
<i>And also a time when encounters and partings
were at the mercy of a greater destiny,</i>

00:00:34.520 --> 00:00:36.650
<i>full of turmoil and sorrow.</i>

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:47.160
<i>The sun was about to rise on
the morning of July 13, 1789.</i>

00:00:50.140 --> 00:00:53.890
<i>For André Grandier, the man who
has always supported Oscar,</i>

00:00:53.890 --> 00:00:59.780
<i>this day would become his very long,
but also very short final day.</i>

